The label a debug build wears.

Debug builds carry the application id `com.taffygo.browser.debug` (decision
0012), so a debug build and a release build install side by side. Two icons
with the same label on one launcher is a real way to lose an afternoon, so
the label is suffixed to match the application id.

This directory is selected in place of `../res/` by `taffy_branding.gni` when
`is_debug` is true. It exists as a separate resource directory rather than as
a second string name because the manifest names one resource, `app_name`, and
the build decides what that resource contains.
-->
<resources>
    <string name="app_name" translatable="false">TaffyGo Debug</string>
</resources>
